{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o036a","title":"曹操破钜野斩薛兰李封","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o036a-account","label":"正文","text":"曹操攻钜野，击败吕布救军，斩薛兰、李封。","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q"]},{"id":"lvzang-a-b484819fd59ce229ad7d","label":"正文","text":"兴平二年间太祖尽复收诸城击破布于钜野布东奔刘备","evidence":["lvzang-q-5257dbb4d1edf898e76f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"攻杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0109","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0110","role":"被杀","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0088","role":"救援失败","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"钜野","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q"]},"time":{"label":"兴平二年夏","year":195,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o036a-q","wudi-q-o035","wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe"],"chronology":"wudi-y195","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o035","basis":"兴平二年夏","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,242,"O036a"],"order":109},{"id":"lizang-e-o004","title":"薛兰李封招李乾欲俱叛，乾不听被杀","accounts":[{"id":"lizang-a-cb851ec441ead74a2f52","label":"正文","text":"薛兰李封招李乾欲俱叛，乾不听被杀","evidence":["lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0109","role":"招乾欲俱叛","evidence":["lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033"]},{"person":"wudi-p0110","role":"招乾欲俱叛","evidence":["lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033"]},{"person":"lizang-p0034","role":"拒招被杀","evidence":["lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033"]},"ordering_evidence":"lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033","source_order":[18,2,80],"order":3609},{"id":"lizang-e-o005","title":"曹操使李整将乾兵击破薛兰李封","accounts":[{"id":"lizang-a-2a583c2fdd9ff2a30b80","label":"正文","text":"曹操使李整将乾兵击破薛兰李封","evidence":["lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"使整将乾兵","evidence":["lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"]},{"person":"lizang-p0039","role":"将乾兵击破薛兰李封","evidence":["lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0109","role":"兵败","evidence":["lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"]},{"person":"wudi-p0110","role":"兵败","evidence":["lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"]},"ordering_evidence":"lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f","source_order":[18,2,106],"order":3610}],"persons":[{"id":"wudi-p0110","name":"李封","evidence":["wudi-q-o036","xunyu-q-o010","lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033","lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"wudi-m-o036-wudi-p0110","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["wudi-q-o036"]},{"id":"xunyu-m-o010-wudi-p0110","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-o010"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"lizang-q-4aaa012dab1854ecb033","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-05cfa81b113d3f6a0be9","layer":"original","quote":"布别驾薛兰、治中李封，招乾，欲俱叛；乾不听，遂杀乾","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":80,"end":105},{"id":"lizang-q-cbc86de35ee69d34873f","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-05cfa81b113d3f6a0be9","layer":"original","quote":"太祖使乾子整，将乾兵，与诸将击兰、封。兰、封破","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":106,"end":129},{"id":"lvzang-q-5257dbb4d1edf898e76f","section":"chapter-007","block":"b-2d73f29c539e1668f151","layer":"original","quote":"二年间〖11〗，太祖乃尽复收诸城。击破布于钜野，布东奔刘备","section_title":"吕布张邈臧洪传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0019.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":47,"end":76},{"id":"wudi-e-o036a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-46b956aeab7b17efb940","layer":"original","quote":"夏，布将薛兰、李封屯钜野〖4〗，太祖攻之。布救兰，兰败；布走，遂斩兰等。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":36},{"id":"wudi-q-b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-927979d68d5dacfd36fe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":246,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-8c38464987eb86819ded","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o035","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-94e8aac81304812fd313","layer":"original","quote":"二年春〖1〗，袭定陶。济阴太守吴资保南城〖2〗，未拔〖3〗。会吕布至，又击破之。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":240,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"wudi-q-o036","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-46b956aeab7b17efb940","layer":"original","quote":"夏，布将薛兰、李封屯钜野〖4〗，太祖攻之。布救兰，兰败；布走，遂斩兰等。布复从东缗与陈宫将万余人来战〖5〗。时太祖兵少，设伏，纵奇兵击；大破之，﹝一﹞布夜走。太祖复攻，拔定陶，分兵平诸县。布东奔刘备；张邈从布，使其弟超将家属保雍丘〖6〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":241,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119},{"id":"xunyu-q-o010","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-4d4e69d499acbe809653","layer":"original","quote":"陶谦死，太祖欲遂取徐州，还乃定布。彧曰：“昔高祖保关中，光武据河内，皆深根固本以制天下；进足以胜敌，退足以坚守。故虽有困败，而终济大业。将军本以兖州首事〖1〗，平山东之难，百姓无不归心悦服。且河、济〖2〗，天下之要地也；今虽残坏，犹易以自保；是亦将军之关中、河内也，不可以不先定。今已破李封、薛兰，若分兵东击陈宫，宫必不敢西顾；以其间勒兵收熟麦〖3〗，约食蓄谷〖4〗，一举而布可破也。破布，然后南结扬州；共讨袁术，以临淮、泗。若舍布而东，多留兵则不足用〖5〗，少留兵则民皆保城，不得樵采。布乘虚寇暴，民心益危；唯鄄城、范、卫可全，其余非己之有：是无兖州也。若徐州不定，将军当安所归乎？且陶谦虽死，徐州未易亡也。彼惩往年之败，将惧而结亲〖6〗，相为表里〖7〗。今东方皆已收麦，必坚壁清野，以待将军；将军攻之不拔，略之无获；不出十日，则十万之众，未战而自困耳。﹝一﹞前讨徐州，威罚实行〖8〗；﹝二﹞其子弟念父兄之耻，必人自为守，无降心；就能破之〖9〗，尚不可有也。夫事固有弃此取彼者〖10〗：以大易小，可也；以安易危，可也；权一时之势〖11〗，不患本之不固，可也〖12〗。今三者莫利，愿将军熟虑之！”","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":498}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
